OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain becoming confined to the far
OL,7,Fnorthwest this evening, turning drier
OL,8,Felsewhere. Further rain across the
OL,9,Fwest overnight but dry in the east.
OL,10,FWindy in the far northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FThe west will see rain
OL,13,Fthrough the day, heavy at times. Drier
OL,14,Fin East Highland with patchy rain at
OL,15,Ftimes and the odd brighter spell.
OL,16,FFresh strong southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
